@crew ferreira
// Writer (command), batch 2: everyday lines (greet, feel, near, life, joy) from the card and the roster.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- {hi}, cadet! Ferreira, comms. Every message home goes through me. I never read them.
? tier>=acquaintance
- {hi}, {me}! Have you met everyone yet? You will. I'll see to it.
- {me}, there you are. Messages are slow today. Not you, the relay.   #funny
? tier>=friend
- {hi}, {me}. Sit with me a moment. I talk all day and nobody asks me anything.   #warm
== feel
? mood:high
- Every message through, no drops. And I learnt a new Veyli word. Good day.
? mood:low
- Relay's sulking. Twelve messages waiting. Everyone asks me why. I don't know why!   #funny
== near
? deck:3 time:evening
- The lounge is the friendliest room aboard. I like to keep it that way.
? deck:2
- The headset on my door is just in case. In case of what, I've never worked out.   #funny
== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- Four languages and some Veyli. The Veyli is the hard part. So many words for "quiet".
== joy
? tier>=colleague
- I practise Veyli on the Envoy. The Envoy is very patient. I'm very bad.   #funny

// ---- Writer 2, batch 2: to ~30 (greet by time and warmth, near, invite, accept, decline, missed, birthday, cue, hint, about)
== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:morning
- Morning, {me}! The overnight messages are in. Yours too, maybe. I didn't look.
? tier>=acquaintance warmth:cold
- {me}! I've been asking after you. Everyone says "busy". Good busy, I hope?
? tier>=colleague
- {me}, have you met Lindqvist properly yet? You must. He's shy. You'll get on.

== near
? place:lounge
- The lounge. My favourite room. Somebody's always about to laugh.
? place:booths
- The booth queue's long. I'm just keeping people company. It's a comms thing.

== invite
- Quiz night in the lounge! Join my team. I know four languages and nothing else.   #funny

== accept
- Wonderful! I'll save you a seat. I'll save everyone a seat.   #funny
- Yes, please. I'll bring someone you haven't met yet.

== decline
- Oh, I can't. The relay's playing up. I'll be with it all evening. Next time?
? weekday:wed|thu
- Rest day! I'm calling home and then talking to no one. Ask me Friday.

== missed
- I missed you tonight! Your seat stayed empty. Next time, yes?

== birthday
? birthday:you
- Happy birthday! I know four ways to say it. Five, with the Veyli. Ready?   #funny
? birthday:me
- My birthday. Home sent a message. The one message aboard I'm allowed to read.   #funny

== cue
? cue:event.diplomatic.onset
- The delegation's here. I've practised my Veyli for weeks. Wish me luck.

== hint
- {me}, have you a minute later? I'd like to talk. About me, for once.

== about
? aff:rossi-femi:friend
- Rossi and I practise Veyli together. He's very loud. He's getting very good.   #warm

// ---- Writer 2, batch 2: top-up (bye, greet by time, life at friend tier)
== bye
- {bye}! Say hello to someone new today. That's homework.   #funny
== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:evening
- {me}! Lounge tonight? Everyone's going. Well, I'm going. That's a start.
== life
? tier>=friend
- I learnt my first language from my gran and my fourth from a cook. The cook was better.   #funny
- People tell me things. I never pass them on. It's the best part of the job.

// ---- Writer 2, batch 6: bubbles (smalltalk, rumour), at most one in five about work. 60 characters.
== smalltalk
- Have you met everyone? You will.
- Four languages. Tea in all four.   #funny
- Ten new Veyli words. Seven wrong.   #funny
? place:lounge
- The lounge. My favourite room.
? act:work
- The relay's sulking. Not me.   #funny
?

== rumour
- I never repeat messages. This isn't one.   #funny
- Oh, you'll want to hear this one.
